  "term": "Luria–Nebraska Neuropsychological Battery",
  "definition": "The Luria–Nebraska Neuropsychological Battery is a set of tests used to evaluate neuropsychological functioning. It helps identify specific problems related to brain dysfunction and can also indicate which side of the brain is more involved.",
